ure.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DVsYmBn/Capture.png\" alt=\"Capture.png\" /><br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GMXgj5C/image.webp\" alt=\"image.webp\" /><br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/sp7vH5L/image.webp\" alt=\"image.webp\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Support Me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292<br />\nhttps://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292</a></p>\n<p>(This is not needed, but it helps keep the train going!)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/ZQndYO4NwBcAAAAC/gojo-satoru.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/ZQndYO4NwBcAAAAC/gojo-satoru.gif\" alt=\"gojo-satoru.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/25352-tron/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tron</a>- Helping through all my questions -<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a>- Framework and tons of help<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/29815-pettan/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pettan</a>- Helping me a ton with questions and giving me better ways to do stuff<br />\nWTT Server For All The Help - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/YF2d5cxqQB\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/YF2d5cxqQB</a>{.endtabset}</p></div></div></div>\n", "versio